1
00:00:00,030 --> 00:00:01,360
B.

2
00:00:01,360 --> 00:00:07,390
Milly and her classmates are talking about their favourite wild animals.

3
00:00:07,390 --> 00:00:12,470
Work in groups and talk about your favourite animals.

4
00:00:12,470 --> 00:00:16,790
Use the conversation below as a model.

5
00:00:16,790 --> 00:00:20,760
What's your favourite wild animal, Kitty?

6
00:00:20,760 --> 00:00:23,220
I like dolphins best.

7
00:00:23,220 --> 00:00:25,370
They're cute and friendly.

8
00:00:25,370 --> 00:00:28,760
They're among the smartest animals on Earth.

9
00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:31,650
What about you, Daniel?

10
00:00:31,650 --> 00:00:33,910
Lions are my favourite.

11
00:00:33,910 --> 00:00:38,430
They're strong and they can run very fast.

12
00:00:38,430 --> 00:00:42,020
They're the king of the animal world.

13
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:44,410
Yes, they are.

14
00:00:44,410 --> 00:00:48,680
What wild animal do you like best, Simon?

15
00:00:48,680 --> 00:00:51,920
I like wolves best.

16
00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:54,960
They often work as a group.

17
00:00:54,960 --> 00:00:58,150
I like their team spirit.
